     fit inside a tab beside Power Search and the Desk. So the tab says
     what Ask is and opens it, in as few words as that takes.

     The button is the reading plan's button (.fr-plan-open), shared
     rather than copied so the two cannot drift apart.

     The old single-shot panel (_ask-panel.hbs) is still in the theme,
     rendered by nothing, until the workspace has been exercised by real
     members; reverting is one line on three pages. --}}
